OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPerhaps the
OL,6,Fodd shower at first this evening,
OL,7,Fbefore clearer skies develop. Feeling
OL,8,Fchilly under clearer skies in a
OL,9,Fnortheasterly breeze, with mist and
OL,10,Ffog patches developing in prone
OL,11,Flocations.
OL,12,
OL,13,CWednesday:FA bright start further
OL,14,Fnorth, with variable amounts of cloud
OL,15,Faround elsewhwere and the odd light
OL,16,Fshower. Sunny spells developing into
OL,17,Fthe afternoon. Around average
OL,18,Ftemperatures in an easterly breeze.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
