OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,6,FRemaining largely dry over the next
OL,7,Ffew days, but cloudier. Chance for a
OL,8,Ffew light showers on Saturday. Winds
OL,9,Feasing but feeling cooler under cloudy
OL,10,Fskies.
